  maxHealth: 90
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 1500
  description: Two fangs, one appetite, and a coil that was a road once. The venom
    crosses its own path because the Serpent has never once considered yours.
  tactics: Aimed spit from alternating fangs plus crossing diagonal volleys that
    lattice the screen. The lattice tightens as it bleeds - the fight gets harder
    as you win, so bank your dodging stamina. Stay off the centerline where the crosses
    overlap.
